{"id":"neulich","lemma":"neulich","pos":"adv","rank":1292,"glosses":["recently (in the recent past)"],"ipa":"/ˈnɔɪ̯lɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5f/De-neulich.ogg/De-neulich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich war neulich dort.","en":"I was there the other day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"there, yonder"}]},{"text":"Danke für neulich.","en":"Thanks for the other day.","words":[{"g":"thanks, thank you"},{"g":"for"},null]},{"text":"Sie hat ihn erst neulich getroffen.","en":"She met him only recently.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"first, at first"},null,{"g":"hit, struck, met"}]},{"text":"Ich habe neulich meine Kamera verloren.","en":"I lost my camera the other day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"camera"},{"g":"lost, missing"}]},{"text":"Wir haben uns neulich getroffen.","en":"We met the other day.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,{"g":"hit, struck, met"}]}]}